('127.51.d.14.C',3,'Before giving an oral medication, a technician should:','["Verify the dose and the patient''s identity", "Mix several drugs", "Skip the chart", "Guess the dose"]'::jsonb,0,'Double-checking prevents medication errors.','original'),
