('127.51.d.14.D',4,'Giving fluids to a dehydrated animal is an example of:','["Behavior training", "Grooming", "Supportive therapy", "Diagnostic imaging"]'::jsonb,2,'Fluids restore hydration and support the body.','original'),
('127.51.d.14.E',3,'If an animal stops breathing, the first priority is to:','["Take a photo", "Wait and see", "Give food", "Alert the vet and start emergency protocol"]'::jsonb,3,'Quick action and clear protocols save lives.','original'),
('127.51.d.14.E',4,'First aid for a bleeding wound includes:','["Applying direct pressure with clean gauze", "Covering with tape only", "Pouring on peroxide repeatedly", "Removing all pressure"]'::jsonb,0,'Pressure helps control bleeding until a vet can treat the wound.','original'),
