('127.51.d.17.D',3,'A prescription label must include:','["Only the clinic''s logo", "Patient name, drug, dose, and directions", "A cartoon", "The owner''s favorite food"]'::jsonb,1,'Clear identification and instructions ensure safe use.','original'),
('127.51.d.17.D',4,'Why list the expiration date on a label?','["To increase price", "It is decoration", "So the owner knows when the medication is no longer safe to use", "To hide the drug name"]'::jsonb,2,'Drugs lose potency or become unsafe after expiring.','original'),
('127.51.d.17.E',3,'A syringe is used to:','["Cut hair", "Weigh animals", "Clean teeth", "Measure and give liquid medication or injections"]'::jsonb,3,'Syringes deliver measured doses.','original'),
