('127.51.d.17.F',4,'An emerging trend in veterinary pharmacology is:','["Eliminating research", "Targeted therapies and new drug delivery methods", "Banning all medication", "Using only herbs for all disease"]'::jsonb,1,'New treatments and delivery options such as long-acting injectables continue to develop.','original'),
('127.51.d.17.F',5,'Why research new veterinary drugs and therapies?','["To make care slower", "To reduce understanding", "To improve treatment results while evaluating safety", "To avoid regulation"]'::jsonb,2,'Ongoing study aims for effective, safe care.','original'),
