('127.52.d.1.D',3,'An employee in animal agriculture has the right to:','["Break animal welfare laws", "A safe workplace and fair treatment", "Ignore safety rules", "Skip training"]'::jsonb,1,'Workers have legal rights and ethical duties.','original'),
('127.52.d.1.D',4,'Following animal welfare laws is an example of:','["Optional courtesy", "Wasting time", "Ethical and lawful conduct", "Ignoring regulation"]'::jsonb,2,'Laws set minimum standards of humane treatment.','original'),
('127.52.d.1.E',2,'A good citizen in agriculture might:','["Ignore property lines", "Pollute water sources", "Avoid community rules", "Help neighbors with animal care during an emergency"]'::jsonb,3,'Citizenship includes responsibility to neighbors and the environment.','original'),
('127.52.d.1.E',3,'Which is a responsible manure practice?','["Applying it in amounts that protect nearby streams", "Dumping it in a river", "Burning in a school yard", "Leaving piles in the road"]'::jsonb,0,'Careful handling protects water and community health.','original'),
