('127.52.d.6.A',4,'Raising and selling market lambs for profit is what type of SAE?','["Exploratory observation", "Entrepreneurship", "Research only", "Placement"]'::jsonb,1,'Owning and running a venture is entrepreneurship.','original'),
('127.52.d.6.B',2,'Why track feed costs in an animal science project?','["To lower animal weight", "To waste time", "To calculate profit or loss", "To hide expenses"]'::jsonb,2,'Cost records show how well the project performs financially.','original'),
