('127.52.d.7.A',3,'Which opportunity lets a student lead in the animal science community?','["Missing practice", "Organizing a livestock judging practice for younger members", "Staying home", "Ignoring the club"]'::jsonb,1,'Leading others builds skills and community.','original'),
('127.52.d.7.B',2,'A program of activities is used by a chapter to:','["Close the club", "Cancel meetings", "Plan events and goals for the year", "Hide the budget"]'::jsonb,2,'It guides what the group accomplishes.','original'),
